  "summary_zh": "以京张铁路历史文脉为根，以AI神经脉络为骨架，以「京张神经突触对时协议」为治理核心，构建「一带三核两翼三缝合口」的可信赖AI创新带。原创性提出将软件工程方法论系统性引入城市规划，提出可对时、可降级、误点可查、可回退、人工终裁五原则，配备13个物理断开开关，设计3个AI朝圣地标、12张场景卡、3个测试场、6类用户画像、全人群包容性设计、分阶段可衡量KPI和完整风险矩阵。",
  "summary_en": "Rooted in Jing-Zhang Railway heritage, structured around AI neural network metaphors, governed by the 'Jing-Zhang Synapse Time-Sync Protocol' with five principles, this proposal innovatively adapts software engineering reliability practices to urban planning. It creates a trustworthy AI innovation belt with 13 physical kill switches, 3 suture nodes, version-based iteration with measurable KPIs, 3 pilgrimage landmarks, 12 scenario cards, inclusive design for all populations, and a complete risk matrix.",
